  "schema:identifier": "id-249a1002c32e50199e27a502ef0ec3d8",
  "schema:name": "SMART Trust demo on the DPI-H Integrated View",
  "schema:description": "The two jurisdictions the demonstrator spans, Thailand (left) and Lao PDR (right), with what they share between them: WHO GDHCN and the WHO SMART Trust specifications. Each country’s systems hold their parts; each part specializes its own country’s instance of a DPI-H RA building block, and that instance the RA’s own block, in the band below both countries (the layers of the RA’s Integrated View, Fig. 3.2). The lines that run from one country to the other are where they meet: the paper DVC the family carries from J1 to J2 and J3, and the VHL QR and ITI-YY5 manifest fetch of J4.1, logged in Lao PDR.",
  "schema:image": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust-demo/archimate/0.1.0/views/id-249a1002c32e50199e27a502ef0ec3d8.svg",
